Sangdong Lake Park Digital Twin (NHI PhotoNano K-Testbed 2026)

1. Ownership
   The source code, 3D modeling and scene composition, shaders, user-interface design,
   purification (UFB and photocatalysis) visualizations and simulation logic, and all
   documentation in this repository (the "Work") are the copyright and intellectual
   property of NanoHydroIn Co., Ltd. "NanoHydroIn", "나노하이드로인" and "NHI PhotoNano"
   are trade and product names of NanoHydroIn Co., Ltd.

2. Permitted use
   The Work may only be viewed through the public repository and website.
   Without prior written consent of NanoHydroIn Co., Ltd., copying, modifying,
   distributing, republishing, creating derivative works from, using commercially,
   or reverse-engineering all or any part of the Work is prohibited.
   Viewing and on-screen demonstration for K-water K-Testbed review and evaluation
   are permitted.

3. Third-party components
   The Work includes third-party components governed by their own licenses, which
   apply to those components instead of this license. See NOTICE.md for details.

4. Disclaimer
   Water-quality values and purification effects shown on screen are conceptual
   visualizations (simulations), not field measurements or numerical-analysis results.
   The Work is provided "as is" without warranty of any kind, express or implied.

Contact: NanoHydroIn Co., Ltd. · https://nanohydroin.com

